{"version":1,"content":"<p>資深藝人「Benz雄」許紹雄離世一周年，從事AI創意的契女（乾女兒）劉思葭在取得許紹雄全部法定繼承人知情同意及授權後，以AI技術製作了一部家庭紀念短片《B組 Ready的前四分鐘》，讓許紹雄再次重現，延續他生前帶給大眾的歡笑與溫暖。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:21:39.986562+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:15.904259+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:15.904259+00:00","content_hash":"7639c308eb24ccec6c969c8ded9cbaabefe33108f48a3410cb266a516fb9baed","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}